Subject: [PATCH] prose_examples 1.0-3: the game example loads its art and
 draws its score

07-game's ship now comes out of lander.png, indexed into a palette of its
own as it loads, and its score is drawn with a system font. Neither is an
array in the source any more, which is the point of both.

